  "title": "Pete: Your Daily Edge for Wellness, Performance, and Longevity",
  "summary": "You don’t have to be an athlete to know that energy, focus, and recovery matter. Whether you’re chasing fitness goals, balancing a busy lifestyle, or simply looking to age well, one factor often gets overlooked: hydration. When hydration slips, performance suffers, fatigue sets in, workouts feel harder, recovery slows, and your mental clarity can even […]",
